}
```

## JavaScript 코드

```JavaScript
let x = 100;
let result = "";
for (x = 1; x <= 5; x++) {  
    if (x == 2)    
        continue;  
    if (x == 4)    
        break;
    result += x + " ";
}

console.log(result);
```

